<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Jaya Property nine-mth net flat.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Jaya Property nine-mth net flat.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>			 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income		 78.33 vs  78.95</p>
<p>    Revenues		  220.10 vs 215.44</p>
<p>    Gross profit	    119.09 vs 122.06</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 91.27 vs  99.07</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   89.23 vs 112.79</p>
<p>Note: The results were unaudited. PT Jaya Real Property is a property company.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
